\fs28 \cf0 Introdu\'e7\'e3o\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Todo aplicativo no Flutter \'e9 criado via c\'f3digo digitado. Para criar seu app, abra o terminal e navegue at\'e9 a pasta onde deseja criar o projeto. Digite o seguinte comando:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 flutter create nome_projeto\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs24 \cf0 Observa\'e7\'e3o:
\f1\b0  No nome do projeto, n\'e3o utilize caracteres especiais ou espa\'e7os.\
Exemplo:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs26 \cf0 $ flutter create primeiro_app\
$ cd primeiro_app\
$ flutter run\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Configura\'e7\'e3o do Ambiente\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Abra o projeto no Android Studio.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Na pasta 
\f2\fs26 lib
\f1\fs24 , abra o arquivo 
\f2\fs26 main.dart
\f1\fs24 .\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Lembre aos alunos que todo c\'f3digo no Flutter \'e9 digitado manualmente. A IDE auxilia com auto-complete, emuladores e depura\'e7\'e3o, mas a codifica\'e7\'e3o pode ser feita em qualquer editor, como VSCode, Android Studio ou at\'e9 mesmo o Bloco de Notas.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Conceito de Widgets\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 No Flutter, tudo s\'e3o 
\f0\b Widgets
\f1\b0  (bot\'f5es, textos, pain\'e9is, imagens, etc.). Passe pelo c\'f3digo j\'e1 criado na aplica\'e7\'e3o de exemplo e destaque as 
\f0\b extens\'f5es dos objetos criados
\f1\b0 .\
Todo 
\f0\b widget
\f1\b0  \'e9 um 
\f0\b objeto
\f1\b0 , sendo criado por interm\'e9dio de classes.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Criando o Primeiro C\'f3digo no Flutter\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Apague todo o conte\'fado do arquivo 
\f2\fs26 main.dart
\f1\fs24 .\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Come\'e7aremos um c\'f3digo do zero para entender e construir tudo do in\'edcio.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Importe o pacote 
\f0\b Material
\f1\b0 : 
\f2\fs26 import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\fs24 O pacote 
\f0\b Material
\f1\b0  cont\'e9m o Material Design a ser aplicado na interface.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Crie o m\'e9todo 
\f2\fs26 main
\f1\fs24  para iniciar a aplica\'e7\'e3o: 
\f2\fs26 void main() \{\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \}\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f1\fs24 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	8	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Agora, criaremos um 
\f0\b Hello World
\f1\b0 : 
\f2\fs26 void main() \{\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	9	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2   runApp(Text("Hello World!", textDirection: TextDirection.ltr));\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	10	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \}\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	11	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\fs24 A fun\'e7\'e3o 
